      "s": 402.0,
      "e": 405.0,
      "text": "The training back home give us the confidence to come and feel"
    },
    {
      "s": 405.0,
      "e": 407.0,
      "text": "the show, everybody else how to do things."
    },
    {
      "s": 407.0,
      "e": 410.0,
      "text": "And you've actually had some hands-on and be able to come out"
    },
    {
      "s": 410.0,
      "e": 411.0,
      "text": "and show the Iraqis how to do it."
    },
    {
      "s": 411.0,
      "e": 421.56,
      "text": "You're more confident if you have some of that."
    },
    {
      "s": 421.56,
      "e": 424.56,
      "text": "The most rewarding part was meeting the Iraqis, really,"
    },
    {
      "s": 424.56,
      "e": 427.56,
      "text": "and seeing how they interact with us."
    },
    {
      "s": 427.56,
      "e": 430.56,
      "text": "They're so thankful that we're here helping them."
    },
    {
      "s": 430.56,
      "e": 436.56,
      "text": "Most of them, they listen well to directions and it's fun to watch."
    },
    {
      "s": 436.56,
      "e": 438.56,
      "text": "They get excited when they do something right,"
    },
    {
      "s": 438.56,
      "e": 441.56,
      "text": "so it's nice to see them learning."
    },
    {
      "s": 441.56,
      "e": 446.56,
      "text": "Is there anything else you like that?"
    },
    {
      "s": 446.56,
      "e": 449.56,
      "text": "Is there anything else you like that?"
    },
    {
      "s": 449.56,
      "e": 452.56,
      "text": "Anybody at home want to say hi to?"
    },
    {
      "s": 452.56,
      "e": 455.56,
      "text": "Yes. I'd like to say hello to my two babies,"
    },
    {
      "s": 455.56,
      "e": 458.56,
      "text": "Colton and Reagan, and my dad."
    },
    {
      "s": 458.56,
      "e": 462.56,
      "text": "So I love you, miss you, and hope to be home soon."
    },
    {
      "s": 462.56,
      "e": 465.56,
      "text": "Oh, let me just do one more thing."
    },
    {
      "s": 465.56,
      "e": 466.56,
      "text": "Alright, listen up."
    },
    {
      "s": 466.56,
      "e": 472.56,
      "text": "Let's pick your favorite part of the training."
    },
    {
      "s": 472.56,
      "e": 475.56,
      "text": "Build a little bit of a relationship with the locals."
    },
    {
      "s": 475.56,
      "e": 478.56,
      "text": "You can tell that they're really starting to trust us and stuff like that"
    },
    {
      "s": 478.56,
      "e": 480.56,
      "text": "with the training."
    },
    {
      "s": 480.56,
      "e": 483.56,
      "text": "This isn't an easy thing for them to do, so it's really cool to see them"
    },
    {
      "s": 483.56,
      "e": 486.56,
      "text": "making that kind of progress."
    },
    {
      "s": 486.56,
      "e": 487.56,
      "text": "Hey, guys!"
    },
    {
      "s": 487.56,
      "e": 489.56,
      "text": "Now, you went..."
    },
    {
      "s": 489.56,
      "e": 492.56,
      "text": "Can you describe to me some of the training that's been going on out here?"
    },
    {
      "s": 492.56,
      "e": 495.56,
      "text": "Well, today we've been working on some repelling training."
    },
    {
      "s": 495.56,
      "e": 498.56,
      "text": "We did a little bit of pick-offs that's called."
    },
    {
      "s": 498.56,
      "e": 501.56,
      "text": "If a victim is stuck somewhere halfway between the top and the ground,"
    },
    {
      "s": 501.56,
      "e": 503.56,
      "text": "we go down and get them."
    },
    {
      "s": 503.56,
      "e": 506.56,
      "text": "We've been teaching the Iraqis how to do that and get the patients"
    },
    {
      "s": 506.56,
      "e": 508.56,
      "text": "safely to the ground."
    },
    {
      "s": 508.56,
      "e": 512.0,
      "text": "Is there anything else you like that?"
    },
    {
      "s": 512.0,
      "e": 514.0,
      "text": "Not really."
    },
    {
      "s": 514.0,
      "e": 516.0,
      "text": "Anybody at home want to say hi to you?"
    },
    {
      "s": 516.0,
      "e": 518.0,
      "text": "Mom, Dad, Carrie, K, Casey."
    },
    {
      "s": 518.0,
      "e": 519.0,
      "text": "I love you guys."
    },
    {
      "s": 519.0,
      "e": 520.0,
      "text": "I miss you."
    },
    {
      "s": 520.0,
      "e": 522.0,
      "text": "And hopefully I'll see you soon."
    },
    {
      "s": 522.0,
      "e": 523.0,
      "text": "Cool."
    },
    {
      "s": 523.0,
      "e": 524.0,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "s": 524.0,
      "e": 525.0,
      "text": "It's Pina Gautt channel time."
    },
    {
      "s": 525.0,
      "e": 526.0,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "s": 526.0,
      "e": 527.0,
      "text": "Alright."
    }
